        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "text": "2nd Haus"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "text": "2026 Collection"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "You are greeted by a gentle breeze and the scent of freshly picked flowers as you check in."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Many dream of hotels as a home. For this collection, Albero presents an escape that still feels like home."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Inspired by a boutique stay, it offers a glimpse of what it might be like if Albero had its own hotel:"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "a space that makes you look forward to coming over, yet feels lived in, as if you’ve always owned it."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Step in, and create your space with Albero."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h2",
              "text": "Experience Your 2nd Haus Here:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "url": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/R1KlNQv1F_8?feature=oembed",
          "title": "2nd Haus: Albero Hotel | ALBERO",
          "provider": "YouTube",
          "description": null,
          "thumbnail": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Here, familiar forms, materials, and textures — the smooth curve of wood, the soft embrace of fabric, the subtle grain under your fingertips — are reimagined in a contemporary setting, creating a home you’ll dream of, yet could truly call your own."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Discover the catalog here:"
            }
          ]
        },
